{
  "title": { "zh": "幅度相同，位置可以不同", "en": "Equal magnitudes, different arrangements" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "重建器能把系数还原成图。现在两张图的纹样位置不同，幅度表却可能很相似。把一张图的幅度与另一张图的相位配起来，看重建后结构跟随哪一张。 <wiki-ref to=\"phase-structure\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "The synthesiser turns coefficients back into an image. Two images can have similar magnitudes while their features sit in different places. Combine the magnitudes from one with the phases from the other and see which image supplies the reconstructed structure. <wiki-ref to=\"phase-structure\"></wiki-ref>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[C[k]=|C[k]|e^{i\\phi_k}\\]\n\n|C[k]| 是该频率的系数长度，φk 是相位。长度决定贡献多大，相位决定它在各位置如何对齐；因此两张图即使频谱幅度相同，也可能有不同排列。零系数没有可保留的相位，保护除数也不能凭空创造它。 <wiki-ref to=\"phase-structure\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[C[k]=|C[k]|e^{i\\phi_k}\\]\n\n|C[k]| is coefficient length and φk its phase. Length controls contribution size; phase controls spatial alignment. Images with identical spectral magnitudes can therefore have different arrangements. A zero coefficient has no phase to preserve, and protecting a denominator cannot invent one. <wiki-ref to=\"phase-structure\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v2_rescale",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "只改长度，保留方向",
        "en": "Change length, retain direction"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "把每对频率系数缩放到给定长度，保持实部与虚部的比例和符号。两分量同为 0 时仍输出 0；用给定下限保护除数。",
        "en": "Rescale each coefficient pair to the supplied length while retaining its component ratio and signs. A zero pair stays zero; use the supplied floor to protect division."
      },
      "after": {
        "zh": "\\[C_{\\mathrm{new}}=C\\,\\frac{m}{\\max(|C|,\\varepsilon)}\\]\n\nm 是目标系数长度，ε 是给定的正下限。共同缩放两个分量可保持方向；当 |C|≥ε 时得到目标长度，保护下限生效时长度可能更小。C=0 仍为 0，因为零向量没有可保留的相位。 <wiki-ref to=\"phase-structure\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "\\[C_{\\mathrm{new}}=C\\,\\frac{m}{\\max(|C|,\\varepsilon)}\\]\n\nm is the requested length and ε the supplied positive floor. Scaling both parts together preserves direction. The target length is reached when |C|≥ε; an active floor can reduce it. C=0 stays zero because a zero vector has no phase to preserve. <wiki-ref to=\"phase-structure\"></wiki-ref>"
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "real", "label": { "zh": "系数实部", "en": "Coefficient real" } },
        { "name": "imag", "label": { "zh": "系数虚部", "en": "Coefficient imaginary" } },
        { "name": "target", "label": { "zh": "目标长度", "en": "Target length" } },
        { "name": "floor", "label": { "zh": "除数下限", "en": "Divisor floor" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "re", "label": { "zh": "缩放实部", "en": "Scaled real" } },
        { "name": "im", "label": { "zh": "缩放虚部", "en": "Scaled imaginary" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "real": [[3, 0], [0, -3]],
            "imag": [[4, -2], [0, 4]],
            "target": [[10, 1], [2, 2.5]],
            "floor": 1e-12
          },
          "expect": { "re": [[6, 0], [0, -1.5]], "im": [[8, -1], [0, 2]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "real": [[-1, 1, 0]],
            "imag": [[1, -1, 0]],
            "target": [[2, 3, 0]],
            "floor": 1e-12
          },
          "expect": {
            "re": [[-1.414213562373095, 2.1213203435596424, 0]],
            "im": [[1.414213562373095, -2.1213203435596424, 0]]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [],
      "solution": [
        "m = magnitude(real,imag)",
        "safe = max(m,floor)",
        "scale = arithmetic[op=div](target,safe)",
        "r = arithmetic[op=mul](real,scale)",
        "i = arithmetic[op=mul](imag,scale)",
        "re <- r",
        "im <- i"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "re <- target",
        "zero = const[value=0]()",
        "z = arithmetic[op=mul](imag,zero)",
        "im <- z"
      ],
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "长度由向量长度元件计算。比例取决于目标长度与当前长度；把两个分量一起改变，观察负号是否保留。",
        "en": "The length component supplies current magnitude. Scaling depends on desired versus current length; change both components together and inspect retained signs."
      },
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": {
            "zh": "频率系数的两分量共同确定长度与方向。同一个正比例同时作用于实部和虚部，会改变长度而保留方向；零系数没有可保留的方向。先在系数表上验证，再交换图像的幅度和相位。 <wiki-ref to=\"phase-structure\"></wiki-ref>",
            "en": "A coefficient pair determines length and direction together. One positive scale changes length while retaining direction; a zero pair has no direction to preserve. Verify coefficient rescaling before exchanging image magnitudes and phases. <wiki-ref to=\"phase-structure\"></wiki-ref>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "长度由向量长度元件计算。比例取决于目标长度与当前长度；把两个分量一起改变，观察负号是否保留。",
          "en": "The length component supplies current magnitude. Scaling depends on desired versus current length; change both components together and inspect retained signs."
        }
      ],
      "adds": ["max"],
      "configurations": { "arithmetic.op": ["div"] },
